  "body": "A new development where quiet, secure living meets the vibrant Browns Bay community.\r\n\r\nNestled in a peaceful, family-friendly cul-de-sac, these brand-new homes offer the perfect blend of space, comfort and convenience for modern family living.\r\n\r\n- Brand New Freehold Home\r\n- Flexible & Spacious Layout\r\n- Elite School Zones & Great Location\r\n- First In, First Served\r\n- Multiple Lots Available\r\n- CCC and Title issued \r\n\r\nSchool zone: Sherwood School, Northcross & Murrays Bay Intermediates, Rangitoto College & Long Bay College",
